The '''Mozos de Escuadra''' ({{IPA-bl|ˈmosuz ðəsˈkwaðɾə}}; {{Literal translation|policing squad}}) is the {{W|state police|autonomous police force}} of the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. As part of its daily duties, ''Mozos'' patrol and investigate crimes across the Metropolis, including on [[Transport in Concordia|public transport]]. Additionally, the [[Servicio Marítimo]] branch of the ''Mozos'' serves as the Metropolitan {{w|coast guard}}. ''Mozos'' are usually stationed at ''casas cuartel'', which are both minor residential garrisons and fully-equipped police stations.

The ''Mozos'' are subject to immediate and extensive [[W:Public oversight|public oversight]] through the Metropolitan [[Investigatory Powers Council]] and the [[Communal Safety and Security Committee]].

